  "assessment": "The degree overview explicitly presents sustainable and inclusive healthcare as interests, and the degree curriculum and assessments substantiate the biomedical and clinical themes. Disease-case examples and individual career trajectories remain search-only. The inclusive-care and patient-experience rows support a coherent behavioural and social health direction. Sustainability of care is a legitimate interest but lacks sufficient programme-level integration in available UCR courses.",
